After my 20th Caveman died around 4th level, I noticed he had the "see
invisible" intrinsic.  I have no idea how he got it.  He had eaten a
gray ooze corpse and gotten cold resistance, and that's the only
intrinsic-gaining thing I'd done with this character.  So I'm wondering
how the hell Oog got the intrinsic?

I went into Wizard mode and ate many blessed tins of gray ooze meat and
never got see inviz.  (cold and poison resistance came up occasionally,
tho'.)

I know you can get the intrinsic by quaffing at fountains (you get a
"You see the image of someone stalking you . . ." message), but IMHO
this is a dangerous practice for low level characters.

Ideas, folks?


